NAME
    gcloud beta network-security security-profiles url-filtering - security
        Profiles - Url Filtering Profile commands

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta network-security security-profiles url-filtering COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Security Profiles - Url Filtering Profile commands.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (BETA) Create a new URL Filtering Profile.

     delete
        (BETA) Delete a URL Filtering Profile.

     describe
        (BETA) Describe a URL Filtering Profile.

     list
        (BETA) List URL Filtering Security Profiles.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud network-security security-profiles url-filtering

        $ gcloud alpha network-security security-profiles url-filtering

